From 967540a9e424124b7fc9494f803d5d04112c49bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:16:27 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Require a random access code after the password on
 login

A correct password no longer logs in: the user model generates a 4-digit code (1000-9999, valid for 5 minutes), the session keeps the pending user id and the code is shown in a flash as a simulated delivery. POST /login/code checks it and only then calls Auth::login. Login helpers for acceptance and access tests now complete the second step.
